{v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_2) ≤ 10
>>
Rule 8 (base and exponent tensors must be broadcast compatible if they have the same number of dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1
>>
Rule 9 (for scalar integer inputs, if base is zero, the exponent must be non-negative)
{v_1 : int, v_2 : int} |= if v_1 = 0 then v_2 ≥ 0
